  <History Date="12-12-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from ArtFox Beam Wash 19E (effectively identical. note documentation provided is titled Beam Wash 19E and only has 20 and 28 channel modes but Capture also have 20, 16, 13 and 24 channel options)" Version="5" />
